From: sss@dark-alexandr.net
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] ik-llama-kimi-k3: add Kimi K3 architecture support

Port of Kimi K3 (LLM_ARCH_KIMI_K3) from mainline llama.cpp (commit
ad1de39e) to ik_llama.cpp. Hybrid architecture with KDA (linear) and
MLA (full) attention layers, latent MoE, cross-layer residual scores,
and situ activation.

12 files changed, 516 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
create mode 100644 src/graphs/build_kimi_k3.cpp

